.TH mnnn-net-search 1  "mnnn-net-search 2.5.1" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-net\-search \- Search here and on every peer that shares with you; results say where they came from
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn net search\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-query\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-journals\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-series\fR] [\fB\-\-records\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-model\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-where\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-source\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-symbol\fR] [\fB\-\-period\fR] [\fB\-\-year\fR] [\fB\-\-from\fR] [\fB\-\-to\fR] [\fB\-\-price\fR] [\fB\-\-min\fR] [\fB\-\-max\fR] [\fB\-\-sort\fR] [\fB\-\-desc\fR] [\fB\-\-asc\fR] [\fB\-\-from\-view\fR] [\fB\-\-clear\fR] [\fB\-\-saved\fR] [\fB\-\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-remote\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search here and on every peer that shares with you; results say where they came from
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-query\fR \fI<QUERY>\fR
Search text (fuzzy; words in any order), like the sidebar search
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-journals\fR
Search journal entries (title and text) instead of series
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-series\fR
Search series (the default)
.TP
\fB\-\-records\fR
Search the records of designed models (every model but bars, or \-\-model)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fI<MODEL>\fR
Only this model\*(Aqs records (implies \-\-records; `all` searches every model again)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-where\fR \fI<COND>\fR
Records meeting a condition, FIELD OP VALUE (implies \-\-records). Repeatable
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Only these sources. Repeatable
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-symbol\fR \fI<SYMBOL>\fR
Only these symbols, e.g. BTC/USDT or btc\-usdt. Repeatable
.TP
\fB\-\-period\fR \fI<DURATION>\fR
Only these bar periods, e.g. 5m, 1h. Repeatable
.TP
\fB\-\-year\fR \fI<YEARS>\fR
Only series covering these years. Repeatable
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<TIME>\fR
Time range start (date or date and time, UTC)
.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR \fI<TIME>\fR
Time range end
.TP
\fB\-\-price\fR \fI<METRIC>\fR
Price filter metric: open, high, low, close, typical, median, ohlc, vwap
.TP
\fB\-\-min\fR \fI<MIN>\fR
Price filter minimum
.TP
\fB\-\-max\fR \fI<MAX>\fR
Price filter maximum
.TP
\fB\-\-sort\fR \fI<SORT>\fR
Sort series by year or name
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
year
.IP \(bu 2
name
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-desc\fR
Sort descending
.TP
\fB\-\-asc\fR
Sort ascending
.TP
\fB\-\-from\-view\fR
Start from the filters and sort the TUI shows now
.TP
\fB\-\-clear\fR
Start with no filters (edit and fork: drop the existing ones first)
.TP
\fB\-\-saved\fR \fI<SEARCH>\fR
A saved live search to run instead of the options
.TP
\fB\-\-only\fR \fI<EXCHANGE>\fR
Only these exchanges or peers
.TP
\fB\-\-remote\-only\fR
Leave out local results
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR [default: 200]
At most this many results per peer
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.5.1
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
